  "findings": [
    "Quick software render control uses a QPaintDevice target and must not call initialize().",
    "QShader and QShaderDescription expose the serialized data and exact reflected fields used here.",
    "Both Qt scanner macros generate the same protocol C basename; separate generation and one compiled definition are required.",
    "SVG plugin advertises SVG reading and constructs QSvgIOHandler.",
    "All seven tested compositor QML type names are declared by the exact QtWayland source; no compositor object is created."
